# Public packages monorepo

This repo (`atmos_dart_pubs`) hosts independently published Dart/Flutter packages under `packages/`.

## Toolchain

- Active Flutter SDK: **3.16.9** (and the Dart SDK that ships with it)
- Target this version for analyze/tests/examples and for `environment` / Flutter constraints unless the user explicitly asks to bump
- Do not assume newer Flutter/Dart APIs that do not exist in 3.16.9

## Layout

- One package per folder: `packages/<package_name>/`
- Root `pubspec.yaml` has `publish_to: none` — never publish the root
- Manage workspace with Melos (`melos.yaml`): `dart run melos bootstrap`

## Editing packages

- Prefer small, reviewable diffs; do not rewrite unrelated packages
- Keep each package publishable on its own (own `pubspec.yaml`, `LICENSE`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `CHANGELOG_RU.md`, `README.md`, `README_RU.md`)
- Public API changes need docs + changelog; avoid silent breaking changes
- Analysis: every package (and package `example/`) uses
  `include: package:atmos_lints/full_2.yaml` in `analysis_options.yaml`
  (`atmos_lints` itself may use `include: lib/full_2.yaml`)
- Cross-package WIP: use Melos path overrides locally; published versions must use version constraints, not `path:`

## Docs EN + RU (README + CHANGELOG)

- Every package under `packages/` must have:
  - `README.md` (English) + `README_RU.md` (Russian)
  - `CHANGELOG.md` (English) + `CHANGELOG_RU.md` (Russian)
- Keep pairs in sync when changing install snippets, features, versions, or user-visible notes
- Cross-link at the top of each file:
  - EN → `Русский: [README_RU.md](README_RU.md).` / `Русский: [CHANGELOG_RU.md](CHANGELOG_RU.md).`
  - RU → `English: [README.md](README.md).` / `English: [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md).`
- README: same structure (Install / Quick start / License); code samples may match; prose in the file’s language
- CHANGELOG: same version headings and bullet coverage; **do not** put `### EN` / `### RU` in one file — split by file instead
- Legacy single-file bilingual changelogs: when touching a package, prefer splitting into `CHANGELOG.md` + `CHANGELOG_RU.md`

## Metadata (required in each package `pubspec.yaml`)

```yaml
repository: https://github.com/Atom735/atmos_dart_pubs/tree/main/packages/<package_name>
issue_tracker: https://github.com/Atom735/atmos_dart_pubs/issues
```

- Keep `name`, `description`, `version`, and `environment.sdk` accurate
- Do not set `publish_to: none` on packages meant for pub.dev

## License

- Root default: BSD 3-Clause (`LICENSE`)
- If a package has its own `LICENSE`, that file wins for that package — do not silently relicense
- AI-assisted code is fine; the package license and copyright still apply as published

## When creating a new package

1. Scaffold under `packages/<name>/` with `lib/`, `pubspec.yaml`, `LICENSE`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `CHANGELOG_RU.md`, `README.md`, `README_RU.md`
2. Point `repository` / `issue_tracker` at this monorepo
3. Add a row to the root `README.md` packages table
4. Run `dart run melos bootstrap`

## Git remote

- After a commit the user asked for (зафиксировать / commit / publish flow), **push to `origin` automatically** (`git push -u origin HEAD` if upstream is missing)
- Do not force-push to `main`/`master` unless the user explicitly requests it
